/P 92 0 R
/E (The County Kids of Steel Triathlon was first held in June 2007, following the final BYST Kids of Steel event in Picton in 2006. When the BYST triathlon did not continue, local sports enthusiasts stepped forward as volunteer race directors and rebranded the event as County Kids of Steel. The triathlon ran successfully each year until June 2019 and, like many community events, faced challenges returning after the pandemic. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
